  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Response to International Migrants in Transit through Honduras</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Camp Coordination and Camp Management (CCCM) Cluster led by IOM and co-led by the Honduran Red Cross, proposes an inclusive approach to improve and increase the humanitarian response in collective centres, particularly in the department of the country with the highest international migrants in transit: El Para&#xED;so. The overall objective of this project is to ensure maintaining the dignity of international migrants through their transit in decent living conditions, with access to safe water, good hygiene, and protection mechanisms.</narrative>
  </description>
